<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-DIAGANA WINS WORLD MEN'S 400 METRES HURDLE TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-DIAGANA WINS WORLD MEN'S 400 METRES HURDLE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frenchman Stephane Diagana won the world men's 400 metres hurdles gold medal on the third day of the world championships on Monday.</p>
<p>Llewellyn Herbert of South Africa took the silver and American Bryan Bronson the bronze.</p>
</text>
